Some mistakes make the totals **differ**:

- an amount posted on **one side only**;
- **different amounts** on the debit and credit sides;
- an amount posted **twice** on the same side, or to the **wrong side**;
- wrong **addition** or balancing.

**Limitations:** agreement is not proof of accuracy; four kinds of error stay hidden; a balance can sit in the wrong account unnoticed; the trial balance tests only the ledger, not the original records.
